# Contact Info Enhancement: Typography and Icons

We will refine the [ContactInfo.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/contact/ContactInfo.tsx) component by adding specific icons to phone numbers and increasing the overall font sizes for better visibility and legibility.

## Proposed Changes

### [Contact Component]
#### [MODIFY] [ContactInfo.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/contact/ContactInfo.tsx)
- Import `PhoneForwarded` from `lucide-react`.
- Update the "Teléfonos" card to display the `PhoneForwarded` icon next to each number.
- Increase font sizes across all elements in the cards:
    - Titles: `text-2xl` -> `text-3xl`
    - Items (Phones/Emails): `text-xs` -> `text-base`
    - Details (Schedule): `text-[10px]/text-[11px]` -> `text-base`
    - Content/Description: `text-[11px]` -> `text-sm`
    - Footer/Small text: `text-[10px]` -> `text-xs`
- Ensure icons remain proportional to the new font sizes.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure the component compiles correctly with new imports.

### Manual Verification
- Visual inspection of the "Teléfonos" card to confirm the presence of the `PhoneForwarded` icon.
- Confirm that font sizes are visibly larger and more readable.
